# Coin up, start, then play
#
# Trace format v1 — see crates/chill65-diff/src/trace.rs.
#
# Committable: trackball deltas and switch levels are our own authored work,
# not game-derived bytes. Plan section 9 forbids ROM images, framebuffers and
# the .MAC/.LDA/.DAT source in this repository; it does not forbid recordings
# of what a player did with the controls.
#
# Coin timing follows the game's own routine (CCN.MAC:269-300, Mike
# Albaugh's): the switch is sampled four times a frame, a valid coin is
# 16-800ms of contact -- so a longer press is not a safer one -- and the
# credit only lands 30 frames later, once $PSTSL, the post-coin slam timer,
# has run down. Pressing start before that does nothing at all.
# 
# Then sweeps in all four directions plus diagonals, at three different
# magnitudes, with a jump between cycles. Start1 is also the jump button:
# the RTL calls the input STARTJMP and the game maps MA.ST1 and MA.BUT
# both to MD6 (CG.MAC:125,127), so one press means different things
# depending on game state.

chill65-trace 1
0 0 - x400
0 0 CoinLeft x10
0 0 - x50
0 0 Start1 x10
6 0 - x28
0 0 - x2
0 6 - x28
0 0 - x2
-6 0 - x28
0 0 - x2
0 -6 - x28
0 0 - x2
3 3 - x28
0 0 - x2
-3 3 - x28
0 0 - x2
12 0 - x28
0 0 - x2
0 12 - x28
0 0 - x2
-12 -12 - x28
0 0 - x2
1 -1 - x28
0 0 - x2
0 0 Start1 x6
0 0 - x4
6 0 - x28
0 0 - x2
0 6 - x28
0 0 - x2
-6 0 - x28
0 0 - x2
0 -6 - x28
